				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Add vendor icons to Tauri and Effect-TS badges in README\n\nPrepend inline SVG vendor icons from simpleicons.org to the existing shields.io badges for Tauri and Effect-TS dependencies. This enhances visual branding and makes the dependency list more immediately recognizable at a glance.",
